{"articleNo":"462043","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=462043&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[등록] '생명 나눔 사랑의 헌혈' 실시 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.09.07","hit":"5323","attachments":[{"name":"1. 헌혈단체 안내자료 23.4.1.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=462043&attachNo=127203"},{"name":"2. 헌혈필수안내문 23.8.22.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=462043&attachNo=127204"},{"name":"3. 헌혈기념품 안내자료 23.4.13.JPG","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=462043&attachNo=127205"},{"name":"4. 헌혈 가능 조건 23.1.11.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=462043&attachNo=127206"},{"name":"5. 전자문진 QR코드 안내.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=462043&attachNo=127207"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 16.5pt; text-indent: -16.5pt; margin-top: 5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">소중한 생명이 위협받지 않고 안정적인 혈액공급이 이루어질 수 있도록 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">단체헌혈</span>을 실시하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 16.5pt; text-indent: -16.5pt; margin-top: 5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈에 적극 협조하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 16.5pt; text-indent: -16.5pt; margin-top: 5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈일시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">9.12.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">), 9.26.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">) 10:00~16:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">학생회관 옆 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">B </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">구역 주차장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">대한적십자사 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈버스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">대 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 3pt; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><b>협조사항</b></span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">신분증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">주민등록증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">운전면허증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">학생증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">모바일신분증 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">지참</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나. \"</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">레드커넥트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">\" </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">스마트폰 헌혈앱 설치 권고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">전자문진 및 검사결과 조회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>기타사항</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈시 봉사시간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">시간 인정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">사회복지자원봉사인증관리시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(VMS) </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">연계</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈자 건강체크</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">혈액검사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">혈액형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">간염</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">간기능 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">ALT, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">총단백 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 다.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈자 대상 헌혈증서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">기념품</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">급식품 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 라.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">오전 헌혈 접수마감 시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 11:30(11:30~12:00 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈진행</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">붙임&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈단체 안내자료 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈필수안내문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(6</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">종</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈기념품 안내자료 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">헌혈 가능 조건 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">전자문진 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">QR</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">코드 안내 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">